; ` *status-line*` holds one atom per placed segment, the left side's
; then the right side's, each in order; equal numbers keep the order in
; which they were first placed. It is rewritten only when the table
; changes, never by a window command.
> (define version (buffers:version line-buffer))
> (in-client (lambda () (commands:run layout:other-view)))
> (in-client (lambda () (commands:run layout-split:split-below)))
> (= version (buffers:version line-buffer))
